<title>SWITZERLAND: Zellweger Luwa 1996 profit steady.</title>
<headline>Zellweger Luwa 1996 profit steady.</headline>
<dateline>USTER, Switzerland 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calender 1996:</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net profit	     27.2		vs 27.1</p>
<p> Div (bearer, Sfr)	    20		  vs 20</p>
<p> Div (regd, Sfr)		four		vs four</p>
<p> Group operating profit     37.8		vs 40.6</p>
<p> Turnover			 1,064	     vs 1,018</p>
<p> Incoming orders		1,043	     vs 1,052</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Zellweger Luwa AG. The company will hold its annual news conference on April 16 and the shareholders' meeting on May 13. -- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
